[[File:Hueycoatl hide coif chathead.png|left]]
'''Hueycoatl hide armour''' is a set of [[Ranged armour]]. All the pieces of armour require 70 [[Ranged]] to equip. Additionally, the body and head require 40 [[Defence]] to equip. 

The pieces can be crafted from [[Hueycoatl hide]], obtained from [[the Hueycoatl]], requiring level 76-78 [[Crafting]] (boostable) depending on the item.

Compared to [[blessed dragonhide armour]], Hueycoatl hide armour possesses higher Magic defence and prayer bonus; the other stats are identical, essentially making most pieces of Hueycoatl hide armour an upgrade to blessed dragonhide. However, the vambraces are an exception, which have identical combat stats to their blessed counterparts. Their only benefit over their blessed counterparts is the lighter weight.

Any two pieces of the armour are required for the combat achievement [[I'm your son]], whilst the coif and vambraces specifically are needed for a [[master clue]] emote step.

